        [
          "✅ 1. Core Concept"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-8096-bd25-deeedaf850b3",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Spring Boot DevTools",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-80dd-9a15-fbed65ae0993",
      "type": "text",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Spring Boot DevTools is a developer utility that enhances the development experience by enabling automatic restarts, live reload, and advanced debugging support during app development."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-803d-bd2d-d2155da2c88b",
      "type": "sub_sub_header",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Spring Boot Actuator",
          [
            [
              "b"
            ]
          ]
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-802e-8268-e369700bb215",
      "type": "text",
      "richText": [
        [
          "Spring Boot Actuator adds production-ready features to your application, such as health checks, metrics, environment info, and application monitoring, making it easier to manage and monitor your app in real-time."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "20824eb1-ed54-80da-805d-d66d59caf99a",
      "type": "divider"
    },
    {
